<title>USA: Galileo names Gregory Riedel CFO.</title>
<headline>Galileo names Gregory Riedel CFO.</headline>
<dateline>STURBRIDGE, MASS. 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Galileo Corp said it hired Gregory Riedel chief financial officer to replace Josef Rokus, who was appointed the head of its new corporate mergers and acquisitions program.</p>
<p>Riedel, 38, was most recently chief financial officer of IPC Information Systems Inc, Galileo said.</p>
<p>Rokus will focus on consolidating and integrating new businesses into Galileo, the company said.</p>
<p>The company did not say what companies it was planning to acquire, or give a timetable.</p>
</text>
